00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.340
Ow! It hurts!

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:42.380
Stop!

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:44.000
Stop it!

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:49.210
It hurts...

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:00.170
It "hurts"?

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.670
Ha!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.750
All you're doing is detecting inputs.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.630
Please!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.710
Not the dark!

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:13.960
Not the scary place!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:21.000
There was nothing I could say or do

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.210
as a few more years passed.

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:27.130
What saved Acca and me from that...

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:35.340
...was Himari, the daughter Azusa left behind.

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:42.130
Himari's presence saved us more than I can say.

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:44.380
She was smart like Acca

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.340
and had a sense of humor like Azusa.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.590
Her carefree cheerfulness

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:54.420
seemed like it would bring us back from
our lowest point to how we used to be.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.290
Uncle,

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:04.960
is it true you and my dad fought over my mom?

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:07.630
Who'd you hear that from?

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:09.380
Come on, tell me.

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:11.420
Well, I guess so.

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:15.090
I got shot down and lost to your dad in no time.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:18.170
Were you sad? Was it hard?

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:19.790
What's this about?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:24.880
I mean, you had to see them happy
together in front of you the whole time.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.130
Yeah, yeah.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:30.040
Thanks for sympathizing
with your luckless uncle.

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:31.250
Can you wait?

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:33.380
Huh?

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.460
Until I grow up.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:38.290
Huh? What are you--

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:41.090
I look like my mom, right?

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:43.540
I'll get more like her.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.670
Yeah, but...

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:48.920
If you wait, I wouldn't mind marrying you.

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:54.210
Don't try to act grown-up, kid.

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:58.170
I'm not a kid! I'm in junior high!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:11.670
That night, Himari died.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:16.250
It looked like suicide, but there was no note.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.380
And what caused it?

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:23.540
Bullying at school? Relationships
with friends? Problems at home?

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:27.540
Acca had shown her love in his own way.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:30.670
So, a sudden impulse?

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:33.460
She wasn't like that. She wasn't.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.630
What the hell is this?

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.210
It was you?

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.460
You killed Himari?

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:16.880
What's wrong?

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:20.290
You won't give me a kiss after so long?

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.920
Answer me.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:23.590
You did it, right?

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:25.380
You did something.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.710
You used Hyphen and Dot.

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.540
You sound awfully certain.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.670
It can't be anything else.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.920
But you...

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.670
You must have been able to do it somehow.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.340
Are you praising me?

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.420
"You're such a good girl, Frill"?

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:41.960
Cut the crap!

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.750
You monster!

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:51.460
What are you so upset for?

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:53.710
It's not like she was your daughter.

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.040
Shut up, monster!

00:18:56.040 --> 00:19:00.090
I'm not a monster. I'm Frill.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:03.210
Listen, I want to get out of here.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.880
Don't you want to know?

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:06.460
About that girl?

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:13.750
Don't you want to know how that girl,
who loved her "uncle" so much, died?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:17.960
Frill!

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:21.420
I completely lost it.

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:23.170
I was as angry as Acca.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:27.630
Actually, I might have hated her even more.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.710
Are you going to kill me?

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.590
You're not human.

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.090
I am human.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:37.210
I'm scared of the dark, and I get toothaches.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:39.000
Shut up, monster.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:42.710
My. Name. Is. Frill.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:47.000
Don't pretend not to see me.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:50.040
I was born from the two of you.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:03.880
We started investigating.

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:08.170
We gathered and analyzed data
on girls' suicides in that age range.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:10.340
There were many causes.

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:13.460
But we wondered if there
could also be another push

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:15.790
that drove them to suicide.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:20.670
The temptation of death?

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:25.960
Unless it's stopped, girls will end up
dying when they don't have to.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:29.040
All because of our mistake.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:34.380
So, we made the Wonder Eggs and looked
for a way to interfere with their plans.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:41.170
What did she think?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.500
Not a clue.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:46.040
What made you want to at least tell Ai?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:48.840
I don't know that either.

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:49.960
But

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:52.540
closing her heart out of fear,

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:55.090
or building walls out of hatred

